  title: Bargaining
  description: My brother hurt me many times when we were younger. I suppose I hurt
    him too but I was \n only defending myself as Father was always on his side.
    In truth, Father was constantly \n near him, watching, monitoring... I guess
    he could have been jealous of my freedom.
